<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Voltaic apt repository</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body {
    font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
    background: #ffffff; color: #16181d;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #0f0f13; color: #e8e8ec; }
    pre { background: #18181d !important; border-color: #2a2a33 !important; }
    a { color: #6cc4f5; }
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
  .sub { color: #6b7280; margin-top: 0; }
  pre {
    background: #f4f4f6; border: 1px solid #e2e2e8; border-radius: 8px;
    padding: .9rem 1rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .875rem;
  }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  footer { margin-top: 2.5rem; color: #6b7280; font-size: .875rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Voltaic apt repository</h1>
<p class="sub">Battery levels for Logitech devices and AirPods in the Linux system tray. Current version: <strong>@VERSION@</strong></p>

<h2>Install</h2>
<pre><code>curl -fsSL https://jcfs.github.io/voltaic/KEY.gpg \
  | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /usr/share/keyrings/voltaic-archive-keyring.gpg

echo "deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/voltaic-archive-keyring.gpg] \
https://jcfs.github.io/voltaic stable main" \
  | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/voltaic.list

sudo apt update
sudo apt install voltaic</code></pre>

<p>Updates then arrive with <code>apt upgrade</code> like any other package. The
package pulls in its GTK dependencies and installs the udev rules that let it
read the receiver, so there is nothing else to set up.</p>

<h2>Uninstall</h2>
<pre><code>sudo apt remove voltaic
sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/voltaic.list \
        /usr/share/keyrings/voltaic-archive-keyring.gpg</code></pre>

<footer>
  <p>Source, issues and other install methods:
     <a href="https://github.com/jcfs/voltaic">github.com/jcfs/voltaic</a></p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
